title: The rest of a line longer than its card is shown beside it under the pointer, and beside the caret while typing
folders: long-lines
expect-log: the rest of line 3 of src/table\.rs is shown beside its card
expect-log: the rest of line 8 of src/table\.rs is shown beside its card
expect-log: the rest of line 6 of src/table\.rs is shown
expect-file: long-lines/src/table.rs :: alpha_0.*here_is_the_caret
forbid-log: the rest of line (1|2|4|5|7|9|10|11|12) of

resize 1600 1000
wait 3000
goto src/table.rs
wait 1500
zoom 0.8
wait 1200
mark card
wait 500
hover src/table.rs 3 40
wait 700
mark rest-of-pairs
wait 500
hover src/table.rs 3 150
wait 500
mark along-the-line
wait 500
hover src/table.rs 3 175
wait 500
mark pointer-on-the-rest
wait 500
hover src/table.rs 8 20
wait 700
mark rest-of-data
wait 500
hover src/table.rs 10 5
wait 600
mark short-line
wait 500
zoom 1.1
wait 1200
hover src/table.rs 6 30
wait 700
mark rest-of-names
wait 500
edit src/table.rs 6 400
wait 800
mark caret-beyond-the-edge
wait 500
type here_is_the_caret
wait 1000
mark typed
wait 500
key save
wait 800
quit
